      "writtenOn": "2026-03-18T10:34:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s on purpose as we require that the value is set by the caller. There is no good default. There is a warning if you forget to set it:\n\n```\n../../src/dawn/native/vulkan/ComputePipelineVk.cpp:89:37: error: missing field \u0027layout\u0027 initializer [-Werror,-Wmissing-designated-field-initializers]\n   89 |                                     }));\n```",
